"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}], "type": "learning_skills"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}], "type": "post_instructions"}], "id": 11}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"contents": [{}], "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "id": 0, "template_override": 1}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"images": [{"time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0, "image": "engenn11le16ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "100", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: So how's the job going?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Today was my last day. The contract ended on Friday, so I am now unemployed again.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Happy?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: A little bit, yeah.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Where's Amy?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: I don't know. She was supposed to be here by now. She is usually very punctual.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:   Amy might have been delayed at work.  You know her, she could have been caught up in an in-depth conversation with one of her clients.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She didn't go into the office today, so she couldn't have been held up at work.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, maybe she was delayed by traffic.", "id": 1, "image": "engenn11le16ob01re2img05.jpg"}, {"time": "36000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Even though there were a lot of cars on the road, traffic moved pretty smoothly today.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Why are you so worried about this? She's just a little bit late whereas you are the one who is usually lagging behind.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: She said she had some news to tell me, so I'm a little uncertain.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Oh, no! Things haven't been going well?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: No. Things seem fine. However, while things seem fine, I sometimes get the feeling that Amy is a little ... restless. Although, we have been together a month now, we still haven't had a serious conversation about our relationship and where things are going.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Well, maybe it's time.", "id": 2, "image": "engenn11le16ob01re2img01.jpg"}, {"time": "80000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Do you know something?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:   No, don't be so paranoid.  I probably wouldn't tell you even if I knew anyway. That would be between the two of you to work out. Listen! It's probably nothing. You must not have understood what she meant. You do that Peter, you don't always listen and then, because you're a pessimist, you often think the worst. Just relax!\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Here she comes.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Hey, guys. Sorry I'm late. I just came from a meeting with Candice.\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: Going on a trip?\n</br><span class=\"strong\">Amy</span>: Yes, I'm going back to Lesotho.", "id": 3, "image": "engenn11le16ob01re2img02.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn11le16ob01re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn11le16ob01re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}